":"ਤਦ (ਉਸ ਨੇ) ਆਪਣੇ (ਸ਼ਰੀਰ) ਨੂੰ ਸਾੜ ਦਿੱਤਾ।"}}},{"verse_id":105794,"page_no":709,"line_no":105794,"gurmukhi":"ਪੁਰਿ ਲਖਤ ਸਾਹਨ ਸਾਹਿ ॥੩੫੬॥","translit_en":"pur lakhat saahan saeh ||356||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"He killed himself with that fire and the people of the city continued to see that great king.129.356."},"pu":{"ss":"(ਸਾਰਾ) ਨਗਰ ਸ਼ਾਹਾ ਦੇ ਸ਼ਾਹ (ਪਾਰਸ ਨਾਥ) ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਰਿਹਾ ਸੀ ॥੩੫੬॥"}}},{"verse_id":105795,"page_no":709,"line_no":105795,"gurmukhi":"ਤਬ ਜਰੀ ਅਗਨਿ ਬਿਸੇਖ ॥","translit_en":"tab jaree agan bisekh ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਤਦ (ਫਿਰ) ਵਿਸ਼ੇਸ਼ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੀ ਅੱਗ ਬਲ ਪਈ।"}}},{"verse_id":105796,"page_no":709,"line_no":105796,"gurmukhi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਣ ਕਾਸਟ ਘਿਰਤ ਅਸੇਖ ॥","translit_en":"tiran kaasaT ghirat asekh ||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Then with many grass-blades, the faggots alongwith ghee (clarified butter),"},"pu":{"ss":"(ਜਿਸ ਵਿਚ) ਬਹੁਤ ਸਾਰੇ ਕੱਖ, ਲਕੜਾ ਅਤੇ ਘਿਓ (ਪਾਇਆ ਹੋਇਆ ਸੀ)।"}}},{"verse_id":105797,"page_no":709,"line_no":105797,"gurmukhi":"ਤਬ ਜਰ੍ਯੋ ਤਾ ਮਹਿ ਰਾਇ ॥","translit_en":"tab jarayo taa meh rai ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਤਦ ਉਸ ਵਿਚ ਰਾਜਾ (ਪਾਰਸ ਨਾਥ) ਸੜ ਗਿਆ।"}}},{"verse_id":105798,"page_no":709,"line_no":105798,"gurmukhi":"ਭਏ ਭਸਮ ਅਦਭੁਤ ਕਾਇ ॥੩੫੭॥","translit_en":"bhe bhasam adhabhut kai ||357||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"The flames of fire arose, in which the king was burnt and his body was reduced to ashes.130.357."},"pu":{"ss":"(ਉਸ ਦੀ) ਅਦਭੁਤ ਦੇਹ ਭਸਮ ਹੋ ਗਈ ॥੩੫੭॥"}}},{"verse_id":105799,"page_no":709,"line_no":105799,"gurmukhi":"ਕਈ ਦ੍ਯੋਸ ਬਰਖ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਨ ॥","translit_en":"kiee dhayos barakh pramaan ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਕਈ ਦਿਨਾ ਅਤੇ ਵਰ੍ਰਹਿਆਂ ਤਕ ਚਿਖਾ"}}},{"verse_id":105800,"page_no":709,"line_no":105800,"gurmukhi":"ਸਲ ਜਰਾ ਜੋਰ ਮਹਾਨ ॥","translit_en":"sal jaraa jor mahaan ||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"That pyre continued to burn for several years, when the body of the king was reduced to ashes"},"pu":{"ss":"('ਸਲ') ਬਹੁਤ ਜ਼ੋਰ ਨਾਲ ਬਲਦੀ ਰਹੀ।"}}},{"verse_id":105801,"page_no":709,"line_no":105801,"gurmukhi":"ਭਈ ਭੂਤ ਭਸਮੀ ਦੇਹ ॥","translit_en":"bhiee bhoot bhasamee dheh ||","transl